9.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kromberg</surname><given-names>JG</given-names></name><name><surname>Castle</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Zwane</surname><given-names>EM</given-names></name><name><surname>Jenkins</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Albinism and skin cancer in Southern Africa</article-title><source>Clin Genet</source><year>1989</year><volume>36</volume><fpage>43</fpage><lpage>52</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2766562</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yakubu</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Mabogunje</surname><given-names>OA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Skin cancer in African albinos</article-title><source>Acta Oncologica</source><year>1993</year><volume>32</volume><fpage>621</fpage><lpage>622</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8260178</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.3109/02841869309092440</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gaigher</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Lund</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Makuya</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A sociological study of children with albinism at a special school in the Limpopo province</article-title><source>Curationis</source><year>2002</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>4</fpage><lpage>11</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14509105</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Luande</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Henschke</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Mohammed</surname><given-names